---
title: "Pond stop / start (CCR 131)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> running

  state "En línea" as running
  state "Deteniendo…" as stopping
  state "Detenido" as stopped
  state "Iniciando…" as starting
  state "Con fallas" as error

  running --> stopping: POST /stop
  stopping --> stopped: job stop ok
  stopped --> starting: POST /start
  starting --> running: job start ok

  stopping --> error: job stop failed
  starting --> error: job start failed

  error --> stopping: POST /retry [stop_pond]
  error --> starting: POST /retry [start_pond|create_pond]

  %% 409 pond_busy — no phase change (documented, not drawn as self-loops):
  %%   stopped  + POST /stop              → 409 (stop needs observed=running)
  %%   running  + POST /start             → 409 (start needs observed=stopped)
  %%   failed   + POST /start|/stop       → 409 (use POST /retry)
  %%   stopping + POST /stop|/start       → 409 (job in flight)
  %%   starting + POST /stop|/start       → 409 (job in flight)
  %%   any + active queued|running job    → 409 (double-click / jobs_one_active)
